  The original sources are pinned, unmodified, as the git submodule upstream/ (with its own LICENSE and NOTICE).
  tests/vectors/ holds bytes recorded from running unmodified Infinispan and JGroups jars; upstream-tools/ holds the
  programs that record them.

Infinispan ProtoStream (https://github.com/infinispan/protostream), Copyright Red Hat, Inc. and individual
contributors, Apache License 2.0.
  Pinned, unmodified, as the git submodule upstream-protostream/.

MockServer (https://www.mock-server.com/), Copyright the MockServer authors, Apache License 2.0.
  The test vectors for the Java serialization of MockServer's own state classes are recorded from those classes
  compiled unmodified (VersionedWrapper, Blob); ExpectationEntry in upstream-tools/ is a structural stand-in.

